message:
Now create three storages on taskmate, all with role-gated CRUD auth:
- Project: { id, name (required), description, ownerId (USER), createdAt (DATE) }
- Task: { id, projectId (relates-to Project), title (required), description, assigneeId (USER),
         status (enum: BACKLOG|IN_PROGRESS|REVIEW|DONE), dueDate, createdAt }
- Comment: { id, taskId (relates-to Task), authorId (USER), body (required), createdAt }
Use sensible defaults for the auth gates (admin: all; everyone else: read; owners can write their own).
Confirm each was created (list_storages at the end is fine).
